    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Classify species by attached benthic versus free planktonic habit and quantify planarity, attached-side flattening and helical displacement from shell scans. Strong habitat-associated differences after phylogenetic and size controls support the claim; no association or opposite patterns refute it.";
